  <h3>Brembo caliper rebuild kits (community part numbers)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Rears:</strong> 143.63034 K6334 (same kit often listed for Camaro/SS rear calipers)</li>
    <li><strong>Fronts:</strong> 143.34032 K3432S</li>
  </ul>
  <img src="/images/brembo-rebuild-kit-parts.jpg" alt="Community post with Brembo front and rear rebuild kit part numbers" />
  <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: -0.5rem;">
    Part numbers confirmed in the community — rears match common Camaro listings.
  </p>

  <h2>Accessory Drive Spacing</h2>
  <p>
    BK1 cars benefit from Corvette-spacing fronts for radiator clearance. F-body (middle) spacing is usable but tighter.
    BK2 has about 1.5&quot; more room up front.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
